  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born from the toxic sludge seeping into the Subchain City hatchery, \"Chrome\" managed to survive his incubation period due to an experimental cryo-beak attachment. He now roams the ruins, patching up fellow ducks with scavenged scrap and a knack for makeshift engineering.",
    "class": "Mechanic/Medic",
    "name": "\"Chrome\" Sniffer",
    "personality": "Wary and grizzled, Chrome doesn't trust easily, hardened by years of watching flocks crumble. Despite his tough exterior, he possesses a deeply buried sense of compassion, often risking his neck to save injured ducks, driven by a need to atone for past failures. His mechanical aptitude is only matched by his cynical wit; he'll fix your wounds, but not without a jab or two.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "\"Salvage Patch\": Chrome quickly repairs mechanical units or heals biological units using scavenged parts. Provides a moderate amount of health and armor, with a chance to also provide a temporary stat bonus based on the parts available.",
